      {
        "pageid": 51534158,
        "ns": 0,
        "title": "Resident Evil: Vendetta",
        "extract": "Resident Evil: Vendetta, known as Biohazard: Vendetta (Japanese: バイオハザード：ヴェンデッタ, Hepburn: Baiohazādo: Vendetta) in Japan, is a 2017 English-language Japanese adult animated biopunk action horror film set in the same universe as the Resident Evil video games. Produced by Marza Animation Planet and Capcom producer Hiroyuki Kobayashi, the film features the characters Chris Redfield, Leon S. Kennedy and Rebecca Chambers. Takashi Shimizu also served as executive producer, and Capcom producer Hiroyuki Kobayashi supervised the film. It is the third CG film, preceded by Resident Evil: Degeneration (2008) and Resident Evil: Damnation (2012), and also the third film installment with Leon Kennedy as a main character. It was released in Japan on May 27, 2017. A sequel, Resident Evil: Death Island, was released in 2023.\n\n",
        "contentmodel": "wikitext",
